Hi {{contact.name}},

Use this one-time link to sign in to Relaybase:

[Continue to Relaybase]({{trigger.loginUrl}})

The link expires in **{{trigger.expiresInMinutes}} minutes**. After that you will need to request a new one from the sign-in screen.

**Request details**

- Account: {{contact.email}}
- Device: {{trigger.deviceSummary}}
- When: {{trigger.requestedAt}}

If you did not try to sign in, you can ignore this email. Do not forward the link — it signs in whoever opens it.

— Relaybase

Hi {{contact.name}},

We received your demo request for **{{trigger.company}}**.

Someone on the team will reply to **{{contact.email}}** within one business day with two or three times that work. If you already know when you are free, reply with a window in your timezone.

**What we captured**

- Company: {{trigger.company}}
- Role: {{trigger.role}}
- Preferred time: {{trigger.preferredTime}}
- Notes: {{trigger.message}}

The session is usually **25 minutes**: domain + Worker setup, one test broadcast, and questions. No deck unless you ask for one.

If you would rather self-serve first, start here: [docs/start](https://relaybase.com/docs/start)

— Relaybase

Hi {{contact.name}},

Thanks — we received payment for **{{trigger.planName}}**.

**Invoice {{trigger.invoiceNumber}}**

- Amount: {{trigger.amount}}
- Period: {{trigger.periodLabel}}
- Paid: {{trigger.paidAt}}

[Download the invoice (PDF)]({{trigger.invoiceUrl}})

This receipt is for your records. The charge appears on your statement as **STRUM / RELAYBASE**. If the amount looks wrong, reply to this email before the next renewal.

Manage plan and payment method: [Billing portal](https://relaybase.com/account/billing)

— Relaybase Billing
